---
description: >-
  Dagre-layout class diagram where namespaces are nested syntactically
  (namespace blocks written inside another namespace block, e.g.
  `namespace Platform { namespace Auth {...} namespace Data {...} }`)
  rather than via dot-notation, with a Gateway class delegating to classes
  in each nested namespace.
config:
  logLevel: 1
  htmlLabels: true
  layout: dagre
---
classDiagram
  namespace Platform {
  namespace Auth {
    class UserService {
      +login()
      +logout()
    }
  }
  namespace Data {
    class Repository {
      +find()
      +save()
    }
  }
  class Gateway {
    +route()
  }
  }
  Gateway --> UserService : delegates
  Gateway --> Repository : delegates
